cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "مقياس (miqyas) — Arabic LLM Benchmark"
message: "If you use these measurements, please cite them."
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Deghaim
    given-names: Mahmoud
    alias: mhdghaim-cell
    website: "https://github.com/mhdghaim-cell"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mhdghaim-cell/arabic-llm-bench"
identifiers:
  - type: url
    value: "https://huggingface.co/datasets/mhdghaim/miqyas-frontdesk-v2"
    description: "Job Trial #1 dataset (episodes and 2,016 conversations) on Hugging Face"
abstract: >-
  Miqyas: independent testing of open-weight AI for Arabic. A leaderboard
  tells you how a model scored; Miqyas tells you what happens when you try
  to use it: tokenizer cost, dialect handling, tool use in real workflows,
  and speed on hardware people own. Protocols pre-registered, raw outputs
  published.
keywords:
  - arabic
  - nlp
  - benchmark
  - local-inference
  - llm
license: MIT
version: "0.2"
date-released: "2026-10-24"
